"<p>Developer and maintainer of the Kasbar TNG code.</p>"
"<hr/><b>Daniel M. Duley (Mosfet)</b> <a "
"href=\"mailto:mosfet@kde.org\">mosfet@kde.org</a>"
"<br><b>Homepage:</b> <a "
"href=\"http://www.mosfet.org/\">http://www.mosfet.org/</a>"
"<p>"
"Mosfet wrote the original Kasbar applet on which this extension is based. "
